    "title": "Jay-Z rape accuser recants story, says they never even met - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brian Niemietz, New York Daily News ,\n1 days ago NEW YORK — The woman who accused Jay-Z of sexually assaulting her in a 2024 lawsuit admits she never even met the 56-year-old music mogul. The accuser identified as “Jane Doe” said in a Southern District of New York court filing that there’s no truth to her earlier claim that he and imprisoned rapper Sean “Diddy” Combs raped her. Read full article",
